          "guid": "mryu448f85hgfgo8",
          "message": {
            "text": "Windows figure measured, not inferred. A one-off windows-latest CI run (workflow dm1780-win-metrics.yml on throwaway branch ci/dm1780-windows-metrics) ran the 8 compressor e2e files with FLIPBOOK_METRICS set and recorded 68 parity checks on win32:\n\n- Clean ceiling: 58 px largest / 93 px total, regionCount === 0 on every check — inside the macOS 71/206 ceiling, far below the 256/512 caps.\n- Mutant (reopen position guard if (k < cursor || k > target) continue; in mergeLevel, src/animation/compressed-run.ts, removed): the out-of-position-reopen fixture breaks at 3712 px with regionCount === 0 — i.e. the strict caps, not the default gate, catch it on Windows too. Reverting the mutant returned the test to green.\n\nConfirms the previously-inferred claim that Windows lands with Linux/near-macOS because --disable-lcd-text neutralizes the same subpixel-text mechanism as ClearType. The Parallels VM path failed (Playwright browser won't finalize under the prlctl exec SYSTEM/session-0 context); CI's real-user runner installs it normally.\n",
            "markdown": "Windows figure measured, not inferred. A one-off `windows-latest` CI run (workflow `dm1780-win-metrics.yml` on throwaway branch `ci/dm1780-windows-metrics`) ran the 8 compressor e2e files with `FLIPBOOK_METRICS` set and recorded 68 parity checks on win32:\n\n- **Clean ceiling: 58 px largest / 93 px total, `regionCount === 0` on every check** — inside the macOS 71/206 ceiling, far below the 256/512 caps.\n- **Mutant** (reopen position guard `if (k < cursor || k > target) continue;` in `mergeLevel`, `src/animation/compressed-run.ts`, removed): the out-of-position-reopen fixture breaks at **3712 px with `regionCount === 0`** — i.e. the strict caps, not the default gate, catch it on Windows too. Reverting the mutant returned the test to green.\n\nConfirms the previously-inferred claim that Windows lands with Linux/near-macOS because `--disable-lcd-text` neutralizes the same subpixel-text mechanism as ClearType. The Parallels VM path failed (Playwright browser won't finalize under the `prlctl exec` SYSTEM/session-0 context); CI's real-user runner installs it normally.\n"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
